{"id":36134,"titulo":"The Sacred Blacksmith","titulo_orig":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cP3KmUi1m0Dnc8OqhPaL2NACyvF.jpg","release_date":"2009-10-03","genres":["drama"],"rating":"6.9","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dI1eAHX69mZGwDPmTNsKSUj06St.jpg","overview":"Cecily Campbell es la única hija de la famosa familia Campbell. Cuando su padre fallece, se une a la prestigiosa Guardia de Caballeros para honrar el legado de su familia. Pronto Cecily se encuentra con un extraño joven con una espada única y un estilo de lucha aún más único. Cecily se entera de que el hombre es Luke Ainsworth, un herrero con un pasado muy misterioso. Pronto Cecily y Luke se convierten en camaradas, y junto con la ayudante del herrero, Lisa y la Espada Demoníaca del Viento, Aria se embarcan en muchas aventuras juntos.","trailer":"","slug":"the-sacred-blacksmith","servidores":[{"id":1,"url":"https://streamwish.to/e/52xaveoybgcj","idioma":"latino","nombre":"Streamwish","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"52xaveoybgcj","player_url":"https://streamwish.to/e/52xaveoybgcj"},{"id":2,"url":"https://bysejikuar.com/e/8hleavlzu3jv","idioma":"latino","nombre":"Filemoon","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"8hleavlzu3jv","player_url":"https://bysejikuar.com/e/8hleavlzu3jv"},{"id":3,"url":"https://filelions.to/v/lmzverhlh2td","idioma":"latino","nombre":"Vidhide","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"lmzverhlh2td","player_url":"https://filelions.to/v/lmzverhlh2td"},{"id":4,"url":"https://voe.sx/e/05yl68nskunm","idioma":"latino","nombre":"Voesx","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"05yl68nskunm","player_url":"https://voe.sx/e/05yl68nskunm"},{"id":5,"url":"https://doodstream.com/e/100wbmmrs1qj","idioma":"latino","nombre":"Doodstream","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"100wbmmrs1qj","player_url":"https://doodstream.com/e/100wbmmrs1qj"},{"id":6,"url":"https://streamwish.to/e/er6e6xvpy0aq","idioma":"latino","nombre":"Streamwish","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"er6e6xvpy0aq","player_url":"https://streamwish.to/e/er6e6xvpy0aq"},{"id